  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Noxious Shot\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Noxious-shot.png\" title=\"Image:Noxious-shot.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Noxious-shot.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Noxious-shot.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Offensive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Ranger\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Deals Poison damage\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>Infuses an arrow with poison magic that explodes into a putrid cloud causing Poison Damage over 2 seconds to several enemies with 4 meters of the target.\n</p><p><b>Requires:</b> Ranged Weapon\n</p><p><b>Cool Down:</b> Varies, Weapon Based\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>...a cloud that causes X Poison Damage over 2 seconds to up to Y enemies within 4 meters of target.</b><br/>* Damage listed is at INT = 10 for comparison purposes.  Damage increase is 1.5 damage points / point of Intellect.\n</p>\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">5\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">6\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">7\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 15\n</td><td> 21\n</td><td> 27\n</td><td> 33\n</td><td> 39\n</td><td> 45\n</td><td> 51\n</td><td> 57\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X*\n</td><td> 104-194\n</td><td> 146-272\n</td><td> 187-349\n</td><td> 229-427\n</td><td> 271-504\n</td><td> 313-582\n</td><td> 354-659\n</td><td> 396-737\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Y\n</td><td> 4\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Mana Cost\n</td><td> 56.4\n</td><td> 71.0\n</td><td> 85.6\n</td><td> 100.1\n</td><td> 114.7\n</td><td> 129.3\n</td><td> 143.9\n</td><td> 158.5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 16704\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">9\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">10\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">11\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">12\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">13\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">14\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">15\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 63\n</td><td> 69\n</td><td> 75\n</td><td> 81\n</td><td> 87\n</td><td> 93\n</td><td> 99\n</td><td> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X*\n</td><td> 438-815\n</td><td> 479-892\n</td><td> 5